{"page":580,"width":1471,"height":1896,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"제4장","words":[{"text":"제4장","x":1107,"y":170,"width":185,"height":85}]},{"text":"드니","words":[{"text":"드니","x":395,"y":368,"width":121,"height":45}]},{"text":"入이","words":[{"text":"入이","x":194,"y":373,"width":142,"height":55}]},{"text":"장 소개","words":[{"text":"장","x":203,"y":587,"width":28,"height":27},{"text":"소개","x":244,"y":585,"width":52,"height":27}]},{"text":"조인의 기본은 NL 조인(Nested lmp Join)이다. 3징에서 설명한 인데스 원리를 이해했다면 NL 조인을 쉽게","words":[{"text":"조인의","x":214,"y":661,"width":72,"height":25},{"text":"기본은","x":300,"y":660,"width":68,"height":26},{"text":"NL","x":377,"y":662,"width":33,"height":21},{"text":"조인(Nested","x":419,"y":657,"width":123,"height":28},{"text":"lmp","x":551,"y":658,"width":51,"height":28},{"text":"Join)이다.","x":608,"y":656,"width":99,"height":28},{"text":"3징에서","x":717,"y":656,"width":71,"height":26},{"text":"설명한","x":800,"y":656,"width":64,"height":25},{"text":"인데스","x":873,"y":655,"width":66,"height":25},{"text":"원리를","x":948,"y":654,"width":66,"height":26},{"text":"이해했다면","x":1024,"y":654,"width":111,"height":26},{"text":"NL","x":1145,"y":656,"width":32,"height":21},{"text":"조인을","x":1187,"y":653,"width":67,"height":26},{"text":"쉽게","x":1264,"y":653,"width":43,"height":26}]},{"text":"이해할 수 있다. NL 조인은 인덱스를 이용한 조인이기 때문이다. 튜닝 원리도 그대로 적용할 수 있다","words":[{"text":"이해할","x":181,"y":702,"width":76,"height":26},{"text":"수","x":269,"y":703,"width":25,"height":24},{"text":"있다.","x":307,"y":701,"width":51,"height":26},{"text":"NL","x":372,"y":703,"width":33,"height":21},{"text":"조인은","x":416,"y":699,"width":66,"height":25},{"text":"인덱스를","x":493,"y":698,"width":82,"height":26},{"text":"이용한","x":586,"y":697,"width":62,"height":27},{"text":"조인이기","x":658,"y":697,"width":81,"height":27},{"text":"때문이다.","x":753,"y":697,"width":89,"height":26},{"text":"튜닝","x":854,"y":696,"width":42,"height":27},{"text":"원리도","x":910,"y":696,"width":66,"height":27},{"text":"그대로","x":987,"y":696,"width":